+ /* ============================================================================
+    System alert, traced from Popup{Dark,Light}Background.png (1071×700, sliced
+    160 and drawn at 44px, so one source pixel is 44/160 of a CSS pixel) and
+    now native CSS; the PNGs are retired. The source is a 967×596 body inset
+    52/27/52/78 inside the slice with a 60px corner radius, a flat top band
+    then an even ramp (dark #565656 → #242424 from 29% to 93%, light #dfdfdf →
+    #939393), a bright ten-pixel lip on top, a faint rim (light on the dark
+    body, dark on the light one) and a baked shadow heaviest below (edge alpha
+    .51 below, .29 at the sides, .09 above). --nse-atmo-alert-slice is the
+    drawn slice width; every metric scales from it, as the border-image did.
+    The generic NSE component owns layout/semantics, while Atmo owns this paint.
+    ========================================================================= */
