+ /* ============================================================================
+    Radio group + tab group — radio-group.png (40×600, 12 cells ×50px).
+    Light silver family. Cell anatomy (art rows 2..47 + a 1px 50%-white
+    underline at row 48): 2px soft stroke (α.43→.24) · 2px white bevel
+    (#f8f8f8/#f6f6f6) · silver fill #d4d4d4→#ececec · 2px shoe (#cacaca/
+    #bdbdbd) · 2px stroke (α.54→.44). Selected = translucent black gradient
+    (α.69→.40, eased) with the same underline; disabled = up art at 50%.
+    Caps are ≈13px arcs with a 2px α.30 side stroke; seams are 1px #a2a2a2
