+
+ /* A captioned divider is [caption][line to the edge]: the line is the cap,
+    never the host. The variant rules above paint the whole element, which ran
+    the soft and grey lines straight through the caption; the host is cleared
+    here (same specificity, later) and the cap carries each variant's line. */
+ [data-nse-theme="com.syndromatic.atmo"] .nse-control-divider.nse-control-divider-captioned {
