+ /* ============================================================================
+    Toolbar fades — top-fade.png / bottom-fade.png, both 8×27, consumed with
+    repeat-x. Measured: horizontally uniform (per-row column range = 0 across
+    every row), colour a flat white, and the alpha an EXACT linear ramp in row
+    index — alpha(y) = round(171 · (26 − y) / 26) for the top fade, mirrored for
+    the bottom. Nothing here is raster: these are native gradients, no SVG twin.
